<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Details of subset of MATH training data</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Table <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix A Details of subset of MATH training data ‣ Learning to Solve Complex Problems via Dataset Decomposition" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, we present the original and sampled sizes of the MATH dataset used in our experiments, broken down by subject domain and difficulty level. Sampling was performed uniformly at random within each group to ensure representative coverage of the various topics and levels.</p>
</div>
