<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A3.F4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 4</span>: </span><span id="A3.F4.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Zero-shot performance of the Qwen3-4B-Base model across difficulty quintiles.<span id="A3.F4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Accuracy decreases as problem difficulty increases, validating our proposed difficulty metric.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
