<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Tag Clustering Details</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We summarize the tag information identified in both the MATH dataset (Table <a href="#A4.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ Appendix D Tag Clustering Details ‣ Learning to Solve Complex Problems via Dataset Decomposition" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>) and the AIME dataset (Tables <a href="#A4.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ Appendix D Tag Clustering Details ‣ Learning to Solve Complex Problems via Dataset Decomposition" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> and <a href="#A4.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ Appendix D Tag Clustering Details ‣ Learning to Solve Complex Problems via Dataset Decomposition" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>).</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T7" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A4.T7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 7</span>: </span><span id="A4.T7.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Summary of Cluster Tags<span id="A4.T7.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. Sample count represents the number of mathematical problems associated with each cluster tag. Keywords are derived from the tags within each cluster.</span></span></figcaption>
<table id="A4.T7.6" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A4.T7.6.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T7.6.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A4.T7.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:99.6pt;">
<span id="A4.T7.6.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T7.6.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Domain</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T7.6.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A4.T7.6.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">#questions</span></td>
<td id="A4.T7.6.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A4.T7.6.1.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="A4.T7.6.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.T7.6.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Keywords</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T7.6.2" class="ltx_tr">
